# Optional: T3 Connect source builds
#
# FORK NOTE: This file is intentionally inert for forks. The lines below are
# commented out so a fork does not silently point at upstream T3 Code's
# production Clerk/relay infrastructure. To enable T3 Connect cloud/relay
# features, supply your OWN Clerk and relay configuration (see
# docs/fork-building.md). With these unset, the desktop app builds and runs as a
# fully usable self-hosted/local application, and the updater feed resolves to
# this fork's own repository (GITHUB_REPOSITORY) so installations never update
# back to upstream T3 Code.
# Do not add server-side secrets to this file.

# Production Clerk instance. To use your own, get these from the Clerk Dashboard
# under API keys, JWT templates, and OAuth applications.
# T3CODE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_your_clerk_publishable_key
# T3CODE_CLERK_JWT_TEMPLATE=t3-relay
# T3CODE_CLERK_CLI_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=your_clerk_oauth_client_id

# Optional: signed macOS passkey builds. The RP domain defaults to the Frontend API
# hostname encoded in T3CODE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY. Set the override only when Clerk
# returns a different RP ID or when multiple domains must be entitled.
# T3CODE_APPLE_TEAM_ID=ABC1234567
# T3CODE_MACOS_PROVISIONING_PROFILE=/absolute/path/to/t3code.provisionprofile
# T3CODE_CLERK_PASSKEY_RP_DOMAINS=example.clerk.accounts.dev,clerk.example.com

# Production relay. For a self-hosted relay, `infra/relay` deploys update it
# automatically.
# T3CODE_RELAY_URL=https://relay.your-domain.example

# Optional: hosted app origin used by the CLI's out-of-band OAuth flow.
# Defaults to https://app.t3.codes; override to test against a staging deployment.
# T3CODE_HOSTED_APP_URL=https://your-hosted-app.example

# Optional: override the desktop updater feed repository. Defaults to
# GITHUB_REPOSITORY (this fork) when unset, so fork builds update from this
# fork's GitHub Releases. Set this only to point at a different release feed.
# T3CODE_DESKTOP_UPDATE_REPOSITORY=your-org/your-fork

# Optional: GitHub OAuth client id for the in-app GitHub device-flow connection.
# Defaults to T3 Code's public OAuth app; override for a self-hosted fork that
# registered its own GitHub OAuth app.
# T3CODE_GITHUB_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=your_github_oauth_client_id

# Public, ingest-only mobile OpenTelemetry configuration.
# T3CODE_MOBILE_OTLP_TRACES_URL=https://api.axiom.co/v1/traces
# T3CODE_MOBILE_OTLP_TRACES_DATASET=t3-code-mobile-traces-dev
# T3CODE_MOBILE_OTLP_TRACES_TOKEN=xaat-...
